{"title":"2003 Pan African MO Problems","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Day_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Day 1</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Problem_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Problem_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 3</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Day_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Day 2</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Problem_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Problem_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Problem_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2.3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 6</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Day_1\">Day 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Day 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_1\">Problem 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/c/7bc270068bad4db9ab3f4f815e46dfa827f731ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{N}_0=\\{0, 1, 2 \\cdots \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"132\" height=\"18\" />. Find all functions: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/d/3ed0397ead7ae8c80d22ebb0d8a32e7788ed1472.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{N}_0 \\to \\mathbb{N}_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"67\" height=\"14\" /> such that:\n</p><p>(1) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/b/42b11a391208e2c3e1209edfaa2eb29735a56c3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n) &lt; f(n+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"129\" height=\"20\" />, all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/f/14fc510a81f4faabc30e3c2d77da688cfb249e6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\in \\mathbb{N}_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"52\" height=\"14\" />;\n</p><p>(2) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/e/64eb03e53983d05c3e97b121504a882e16901e22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(2)=2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"67\" height=\"18\" />;\n</p><p>(3) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/f/86f9146277644a2e2b34f2a629d1de97fdeb8836.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(mn)=f(m)f(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"151\" height=\"18\" />, all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/f/c6f50291897389d3e8d1b7e1547a4e35cc99d85a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m, n \\in \\mathbb{N}_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 1\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>The circumference of a circle is arbitrarily divided into four arcs. The midpoints of the arcs are connected by segments. Show that two of these segments are perpendicular.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 2\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_3\">Problem 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Does there exists a base in which the numbers of the form:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/a/c9a02892205a5151aec6c5803e1e554fd2553b8f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[10101, 101010101, 1010101010101,\\cdots\\]\" width=\"288\" height=\"16\" />\nare all prime numbers?\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 3\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Day_2\">Day 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Day 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_4\">Problem 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/f/ddfa12329d02f3618e6ebadc0c574ffe9d387b91.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{N}_0=\\{0,1,2 \\cdots \\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"132\" height=\"18\" />. Does there exist a function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/e/38e45ca03a11e23da9bd478496a3c4b521c3759c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f: \\mathbb{N}_0 \\to \\mathbb{N}_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" /> such that:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/4/2146fb4becc1f80f67da479190d7459f6d0017c2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f^{2003}(n)=5n, \\forall n \\in \\mathbb{N}_0\\]\" width=\"177\" height=\"19\" />\nwhere we define: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/4/0840e4b2dc1baec5ef59536cfbac70cf77965efa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^1(n)=f(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"102\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/9/319a10fc64f626cc888fb7875b21cffbd56a56e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f^{k+1}(n)=f(f^k(n))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"152\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/a/3ba55cfd261762cc9ed11875fe8ebaf79ea07b46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\forall k \\in \\mathbb{N}_0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 4\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_5\">Problem 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Find all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/5/f25d31faf472ddb4c698a14522fe8125c06f8dd8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/e/dae66c1fc9b2b4379efbc4bbea97c50ead1c9226.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{2^n}+2^n+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"95\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 5\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_6\">Problem 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>Find all functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/e/65edf4e07e54fbb2a62d0429efd621867fee7266.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f: \\mathbb{R} \\to \\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"79\" height=\"16\" /> such that:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/3/fa384b7aa45701e22e3f8eec20955df11bd6dfc6.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[f(x^2)-f(y^2)=(x+y)(f(x)-f(y))\\]\" width=\"292\" height=\"19\" />\nfor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/6/c56df81157e7052306c4785297ad7e2c80a012c5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x,y \\in \\mathbb{R}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"63\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 6\">Solution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO\">2003 Pan African MO</a></b> (<b><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2002_Pan_African_MO\" title=\"2002 Pan African MO\">2002 Pan African MO</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2003_Pan_African_MO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2003 Pan African MO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_Pan_African_MO\" title=\"2004 Pan African MO\">2004 Pan African MO</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Pan_African_MO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"Pan African MO Problems and Solutions\"> All Pan African MO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018050047\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.057 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 153/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 904/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 78/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3776/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.675      1 Template:Pan_African_MO_box\n100.00%    7.675      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17895:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018050047 and revision id 112582. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}